<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/c1294abd3c7ab19fa0fb980373af732315b8a5be/docs/src/app/(docs)/react/components/autocomplete/demos/grouped/tailwind/index.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="autocomplete" data-kv-variant="timezone" data-klic-component="autocomplete" class="kn-autocomplete"><header data-part="heading"><strong>워크스페이스 시간대</strong></header><label data-part="field"><span>도시 / 시간대</span><input list="kv-export-autocomplete-autocomplete-timezone-suggest"  placeholder="입력하거나 후보를 선택하세요" data-part="input"></label><datalist id="kv-export-autocomplete-autocomplete-timezone-suggest"><option value="Asia/Seoul"></option><option value="Asia/Tokyo"></option><option value="Europe/London"></option><option value="America/New_York"></option></datalist><p data-part="muted">팀의 업무 시간 기준으로 사용합니다.</p></div>
